# AjoAI MiniPay app — copy to .env.local (gitignored). All public (NEXT_PUBLIC_*).
# The circle members will see; defaults to the live demo circle in lib/chain.ts.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CIRCLE=0xc578127F2978896ef1b4995CE44D780C89676cb4

# Chain selector: "mainnet" (default) | "sepolia". See lib/chain.ts.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAIN=mainnet

# DeepSeek key (model "deepseek-chat") — powers the LLM-phrased NL answers in the circle page's
# "Ask" tab (app/app/api/ask/route.ts) and the MCP `ask` tool. Without it BOTH surfaces fall back
# to the deterministic chain-derived answer, which is money-accurate but identical for every
# question. The response's `mode`/`reason` fields tell you which path ran.
#
# NOTE: this is the SAME name the Python agent uses (agent/src/config.py), but a DIFFERENT file —
# Next.js only loads miniapp/.env*, never the repo-root .env. It must also be set on the Vercel
# project that serves the live domain. SERVER-SIDE ONLY — no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix.
# LLM_API_KEY=
